<title>GERMANY: Douglas 9-mo sales, profit slightly up.</title>
<headline>Douglas 9-mo sales, profit slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>HAGEN, Germany 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,800   up 3.5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German retail group is Douglas Holding AG. Douglas also said that its profit from ordinary activities was up slightly from the year-earlier level.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
